Project management commands.

USAGE:
  scw account project <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  create         Create a new Project for an Organization
  delete         Delete an existing Project
  get            Get an existing Project
  list           List all Projects of an Organization
  list-resources List all resources across all zones
  update         Update Project

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for project
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw account project [command] --help" for more information about a command.
